WEBVTT

00:00.990 --> 00:06.930
Zankoku na tenshi no you ni

00:00.990 --> 00:06.930
Just like the cruel angel

00:06.930 --> 00:14.590
Shounen yo shinwa ni nare

00:06.930 --> 00:14.590
Young boy, become a legend

00:18.990 --> 00:22.410
2D4U PRESENTS:

00:22.770 --> 00:25.810
Aoi kaze ga ima

00:22.770 --> 00:25.810
Even though the untested breeze...

00:25.810 --> 00:29.510
mune no doa o tataitemo

00:25.810 --> 00:29.510
...taps at the door to your heart

00:29.510 --> 00:36.970
Watashi dake o tada mitsumete hohoenderu anata

00:29.510 --> 00:36.970
You just look solely at me and smile

00:37.560 --> 00:44.500
Sotto fureru mono motomeru koto ni muchuu de

00:37.560 --> 00:44.500
So intent on seeking out that gentle touch

00:44.500 --> 00:51.400
Unmei sae mada shiranai itaike na hitomi

00:44.500 --> 00:51.400
Such innocent eyes, still ignorant of their destiny

00:52.000 --> 00:55.750
Dakedo itsuka kizuku deshou

00:52.000 --> 00:55.750
But someday, you are sure to realize...

00:55.750 --> 00:58.340
sono senaka ni wa

00:55.750 --> 00:58.340
...that upon your back

00:59.510 --> 01:02.960
Haruka mirai mezasu tame

00:59.510 --> 01:02.960
You have the wings with which to fly...

01:02.960 --> 01:06.310
no hane ga aru koto

01:02.960 --> 01:06.310
...towards the distant future

01:06.990 --> 01:10.690
Zankoku na tenshi no teeze

01:06.990 --> 01:10.690
The cruel angel's thesis

01:10.690 --> 01:14.430
Madobe kara yagate tobidatsu

01:10.690 --> 01:14.430
Soon, you will take flight from the windowsill

01:14.430 --> 01:18.200
Hotobashiru atsui patosu de

01:14.430 --> 01:18.200
With your torrent of ardent pathos

01:18.200 --> 01:21.900
Omoide o uragiru nara

01:18.200 --> 01:21.900
If you are to betray our memories

01:21.900 --> 01:25.540
Kono sora o daite kagayaku

01:21.900 --> 01:25.540
You, who embrace these heavens and shine

01:25.540 --> 01:29.270
Shounen yo shinwa ni nare

01:25.540 --> 01:29.270
Young boy, become a legend

01:36.700 --> 01:38.620
It's eating the Angel?

01:56.470 --> 02:00.600
And now those bindings are being undone
by the Eva's own might.

02:00.600 --> 02:03.640
We can no longer stop the Eva.

02:05.980 --> 02:08.730
Unit 01's been awakened and set free.

02:08.730 --> 02:11.400
Seele won't stay quiet for this.

02:13.400 --> 02:16.900
The Eva series aren't capable of
generating S2 engines themselves.

02:16.900 --> 02:20.160
We never imagined it would take one
into itself this way.

02:20.160 --> 02:24.790
This incident is at extreme odds with our script.

02:24.790 --> 02:26.790
It will not be easy to correct for this.

02:26.790 --> 02:32.040
Were we not mistaken to have entrusted Nerv
to Gendo Ikari in the first place?

02:32.040 --> 02:37.010
But without that man, we could not have
executed all of our plans.

02:37.010 --> 02:40.090
Ikari, what are you thinking?

02:40.090 --> 02:41.470
It's begun, hasn't it?

02:41.470 --> 02:44.140
Yes, it all begins here.

02:44.180 --> 02:47.140
FORM OF THE MIND
FORM OF THE MAN

02:44.180 --> 02:47.140
EPISODE 20

02:49.190 --> 02:53.270
Damage on both Eva units
is beyond the Hayflick Limit.

02:53.270 --> 02:56.780
It'll take time before everything
goes back to normal.

02:56.780 --> 02:59.780
Fortunately, the Magi System can be transferred.

03:00.410 --> 03:02.490
We'll start working on that as early as tomorrow.

03:03.030 --> 03:04.910
But this place will have to be scrapped.

03:04.910 --> 03:07.620
It's just a matter of time before
the brass decides to abandon it.

03:07.620 --> 03:09.000
That's true.

03:09.000 --> 03:13.170
For the time being, we'll have to use
the backup Secondary Control Center.

03:13.170 --> 03:15.340
You mean, even without the Magi?

03:15.340 --> 03:16.840
That's right.

03:16.840 --> 03:19.970
We'll dust it off and be working again
by this afternoon.

03:19.970 --> 03:22.430
But these chairs are hard, and the sensors
haven't been broken in,

03:22.430 --> 03:24.390
so it's difficult to work here.

03:24.390 --> 03:27.680
Even though the layout is the same as
the control center we're familiar with.

03:27.680 --> 03:29.310
It just doesn't feel right, you know?

03:29.310 --> 03:31.270
At least we can use this place.

03:32.100 --> 03:34.810
But what we don't know is whether
we can still use Unit 01.

03:40.950 --> 03:43.870
Restrained by the cage... are you sure it's safe?

03:43.870 --> 03:48.790
No internal thermal, electron, electromagnetic,
or chemical energy readings are being detected.

03:48.790 --> 03:51.040
The S2 engine is completely inactive.

03:51.040 --> 03:54.710
Nevertheless, under those conditions, Unit 01
has moved on three separate occasions.

03:58.760 --> 04:02.550
You can't treat it carelessly based only
on what we can see and measure.

04:02.550 --> 04:05.850
We don't know what it'll do if
we meddle with it carelessly.

04:05.850 --> 04:07.720
Just like you, Miss Katsuragi.

04:11.390 --> 04:13.060
I'm sorry.

04:13.060 --> 04:16.360
However, our concerns are not
limited to Unit 01.

04:16.360 --> 04:19.280
Correct. Serious damage was sustained
by Units 00 and 02.

04:19.280 --> 04:22.950
Headquarters was partially destroyed,
Central Dogma exposed.

04:22.950 --> 04:24.700
The damages are enormous.

04:24.700 --> 04:28.910
We can't even estimate how much
money and time we've lost.

04:28.910 --> 04:31.830
All this is because we didn't put
a bell around Ikari's neck.

04:31.830 --> 04:34.620
There is a bell, it just didn't ring.

04:34.620 --> 04:36.750
A bell that doesn't ring serves no purpose.

04:36.750 --> 04:39.170
We'll have the bell take action next time.

04:39.170 --> 04:42.300
My, my, what an unexpected turn of events.

04:43.880 --> 04:48.640
The committee... I mean, how do you
intend to explain this to Seele?

04:48.640 --> 04:52.270
Unit 01 wasn't under our control.

04:52.270 --> 04:54.390
This was an unexpected accident.

04:54.390 --> 04:58.400
Therefore Unit 01 will stay frozen until
the Committee gives us further orders.

04:58.400 --> 05:00.230
That's a very appropriate decision.

05:00.230 --> 05:03.280
However, is your son still trapped inside it?

05:05.700 --> 05:09.580
As expected, it's not working. The code to
eject the entry plug isn't being accepted.

05:09.580 --> 05:11.080
What about the backup and dummy signals?

05:11.080 --> 05:14.160
They're being refused. We can't open
a direct circuit either.

05:14.540 --> 05:16.960
We've connected to the plug's video monitor.

05:16.960 --> 05:18.080
Switching to the main monitor.

05:20.460 --> 05:21.880
What in the hell is this?

05:22.880 --> 05:25.720
This is the truth behind the 400% synch rate.

05:25.720 --> 05:28.970
I can't believe it. What in the world
happened to Shinji?

05:28.970 --> 05:31.350
He's been taken into Eva Unit 01.

05:31.350 --> 05:34.310
What does that mean?! Just what is an Eva?!

05:34.310 --> 05:37.770
It is something created by man
in man's own image.

05:37.770 --> 05:39.190
I really can't describe it any other way.

05:39.190 --> 05:40.900
Something created by man?

05:41.230 --> 05:44.990
Didn't you just copy what you found then
at the South Pole?

05:44.990 --> 05:46.820
I'm sure the original would be
appalled to hear this.

05:46.820 --> 05:50.740
This is not just a copy, because
it is imbued with a human will.

05:50.740 --> 05:52.830
Are you saying somebody
willed this to happen as well?!

05:52.830 --> 05:54.370
It could be the Eva's...

05:55.710 --> 05:57.460
Do something, damn you!

05:57.460 --> 06:00.540
You created it, didn't you?!
Take responsibility for it!

06:03.550 --> 06:06.090
<i><i>On the issue of the Nansa Islands,</i></i>

06:06.090 --> 06:09.050
<i><i>the government has officially announced
there is no federal involvement.</i></i>

06:09.050 --> 06:14.520
<i><i>In other news, it has been a month
since the terrorist act in Tokyo-2,</i></i>

06:14.520 --> 06:18.060
<i><i>and the government has passed
new legislation to prevent another.</i></i>

06:16.850 --> 06:18.060
I'm still alive.

06:19.850 --> 06:23.070
I got that she made it, okay?!

06:23.070 --> 06:26.900
Damn it, Misato, don't keep calling me
over every little thing!

06:30.200 --> 06:33.830
To think... to think I couldn't do anything!

06:33.830 --> 06:36.500
I can't believe I lost to that stupid Shinji!

06:38.080 --> 06:39.370
I hate this!

06:41.130 --> 06:43.540
A plan to salvage Shinji?

06:43.540 --> 06:47.550
That's right. That which can be called
Shinji's life still exists.

06:47.550 --> 06:49.590
Now you're respecting human life?

06:49.590 --> 06:51.970
We can't afford to lose Shinji right now.

06:51.970 --> 06:53.140
Well, I wonder?

06:53.140 --> 06:57.770
Isn't what Nerv wants not Shinji's life,
but Unit 01 as its tool?

06:57.770 --> 07:00.140
I won't deny it.

07:00.140 --> 07:03.440
We can surmise that Shinji's body
lost its ego border,

07:03.440 --> 07:07.400
and he's floating in the entry plug
in quantum form.

07:07.400 --> 07:12.370
In other words, Shinji has shifted
into a form we can't see?

07:12.370 --> 07:15.530
Yes, the composition of the LCL inside the plug
has chemically altered

07:15.530 --> 07:20.250
into something very similar to the
sea water of primitive Earth.

07:20.250 --> 07:22.040
A soup of life, huh?

07:22.040 --> 07:26.300
All of the substances which composed Shinji
are still preserved in the plug,

07:26.300 --> 07:29.170
and what could be called his soul
exists there as well.

07:29.170 --> 07:33.430
In fact, his self-image is pseudo-
substantiating his plug suit.

07:33.430 --> 07:35.010
In other words, salvaging him means

07:35.010 --> 07:39.020
reconstructing his body and
anchoring his psyche within it.

07:39.020 --> 07:40.600
Is that possible?

07:40.600 --> 07:42.140
With the Magi's support, yes.

07:42.140 --> 07:44.520
Theoretically, right?

07:44.520 --> 07:46.940
You can't know what will happen until you try it.

07:51.360 --> 07:53.320
What is this?

07:53.320 --> 07:54.910
Where am I?

07:55.240 --> 07:56.990
In the entry plug?

07:56.990 --> 07:58.700
In Unit 01?

07:58.700 --> 08:01.500
But there's nobody here. I'm not even here.

08:01.660 --> 08:05.130
What is this? What is this? What is this?

08:05.170 --> 08:06.670
I don't really understand.

08:07.880 --> 08:09.420
These people...

08:09.510 --> 08:14.510
Yes, they're people I know,
people who know me.

08:14.590 --> 08:17.050
I see. This is all part of my world.

08:17.970 --> 08:19.600
What is this?

08:19.600 --> 08:23.060
This is supposed to be my world,
but I don't really understand.

08:23.060 --> 08:24.980
An image from outside?

08:24.980 --> 08:26.360
An unpleasant image?

08:26.360 --> 08:28.110
That's right! The enemy!

08:28.730 --> 08:31.150
Enemy! Enemy! Enemy! Enemy!

08:32.150 --> 08:35.280
Our enemies, the Angels, given
the names of heavenly beings.

08:35.740 --> 08:38.240
They are the targets of the Evas and Nerv.

08:39.040 --> 08:41.160
The object of revenge for Miss Misato's father!

08:41.830 --> 08:45.460
Why do I fight despite all I've been put through?

08:45.710 --> 08:47.500
What are you, stupid?

08:47.540 --> 08:50.250
Strange beings are attacking us.

08:50.300 --> 08:53.670
If you're going through a fire, you've got to
brush away the embers, of course!

08:54.090 --> 08:56.550
Maybe I don't need a reason.

08:56.550 --> 08:58.720
Maybe I'm not supposed to think about it.

08:58.760 --> 09:02.020
Enemy! Enemy! Enemy! Enemy!

09:02.020 --> 09:03.520
They're all my enemies!

09:03.520 --> 09:07.190
Those that threaten me... us...
they are the enemy.

09:07.190 --> 09:11.820
That's right! What's wrong with
protecting my life, our lives?!

09:11.860 --> 09:13.820
Enemy! Enemy! Enemy! Enemy!

09:13.900 --> 09:15.950
My enemy! My enemy!

09:19.990 --> 09:22.950
Damn! Damn! Damn!

09:22.950 --> 09:26.040
How dare you hurt Toji and kill my mother!

09:26.040 --> 09:26.870
Father!

09:37.180 --> 09:39.470
Why do you hate your father?

09:39.470 --> 09:42.470
Of course! Anyone would.

09:42.470 --> 09:44.520
You can't understand your father?

09:44.520 --> 09:47.650
Of course not. I've hardly ever seen him.

09:48.060 --> 09:49.650
Is that why you hate him?

09:49.650 --> 09:54.400
Yes, my father doesn't need me!
My father deserted me!

09:54.400 --> 09:56.240
And am I the substitute?

09:56.240 --> 09:58.700
That's right! That's got to be it!

09:58.700 --> 10:01.410
He abandoned me because he had you!

10:01.410 --> 10:03.700
As if you didn't run away all by yourself.

10:03.740 --> 10:06.410
Shut up! Shut up! Shut up!

10:04.290 --> 10:04.330
Rei Ayanami

10:04.330 --> 10:04.370
Gendo Ikari

10:04.370 --> 10:04.410
Yui Ikari

10:04.410 --> 10:04.450
Father

10:04.450 --> 10:04.500
Mother

10:04.500 --> 10:04.540
Child

10:04.540 --> 10:04.580
Stranger

10:04.580 --> 10:04.660
Self

10:04.660 --> 10:04.790
The Ego

10:04.790 --> 10:04.830
Hypocrisy

10:04.830 --> 10:04.870
Needs

10:04.870 --> 10:04.910
Repression

10:04.910 --> 10:04.950
The Weak

10:04.950 --> 10:05.000
Identification

10:05.000 --> 10:05.040
Self

10:05.040 --> 10:05.080
Internalization

10:05.080 --> 10:05.120
Breasts

10:05.120 --> 10:05.160
Inferiority Complex

10:05.160 --> 10:05.200
Will

10:05.200 --> 10:05.290
Symbiosis

10:05.290 --> 10:05.330
Solitude

10:05.330 --> 10:05.370
Compensation

10:05.370 --> 10:05.450
Reality

10:05.450 --> 10:05.500
Ideal

10:05.500 --> 10:05.540
Inculcation

10:05.540 --> 10:05.620
Mind and Body

10:05.620 --> 10:05.660
Fear

10:05.660 --> 10:05.700
Insecurity

10:05.700 --> 10:05.750
Value

10:05.750 --> 10:05.830
Dependence

10:05.830 --> 10:05.870
Escape

10:05.870 --> 10:05.910
Estrangement

10:05.910 --> 10:05.960
Loss

10:05.960 --> 10:06.000
Oral Stage

10:06.000 --> 10:06.040
Obsession

10:06.410 --> 10:08.620
It's all his fault!!

10:08.620 --> 10:11.590
That time, I was actually going
to tell him I hate him!

10:09.130 --> 10:09.380
Come.
Gendo lkari

10:11.340 --> 10:11.590
Welcome to
Nerv

10:15.420 --> 10:19.180
Are you telling me to get on that thing
and put myself in danger, Father?

10:19.180 --> 10:20.140
Correct.

10:20.140 --> 10:23.720
What's with that?! I don't want to!
Why are you saying this now?!

10:23.720 --> 10:26.480
I thought you didn't need me, Father!

10:26.480 --> 10:28.770
I merely called you because I needed you.

10:30.230 --> 10:32.440
Why me?

10:32.440 --> 10:34.650
Because it's impossible for anyone else.

10:35.860 --> 10:38.070
But that's impossible.

10:38.070 --> 10:41.530
I've never even seen or heard of it.
There's no way I could do it!

10:42.620 --> 10:44.950
No, I knew.

10:44.950 --> 10:47.910
That's right! I knew the Eva.

10:48.210 --> 10:51.000
And that time, I ran away!

10:51.000 --> 10:52.170
Away from Mother and Father!

11:00.970 --> 11:03.760
Current LCL temperature
holding steady at 36 degrees.

11:03.760 --> 11:05.510
No problem with oxygen concentration.

11:05.510 --> 11:08.730
Electromagnetic radiation pulse is normal.
Wave pattern is B.

11:08.730 --> 11:11.230
All instrumentation is functioning normally.

11:11.900 --> 11:14.270
OPERATION PLAN

11:11.900 --> 11:14.270
TYPE EP2 SALVAGE WORK PROCEDURAL OUTLINE
(AND TYPE LP3 COMPLEMENTATION PROCEDURE)

11:11.900 --> 11:14.650
Salvage Plan Outline...

11:14.650 --> 11:18.240
Only you could have created
all this in just one month.

11:18.240 --> 11:20.990
Unfortunately, I didn't come up with the idea.

11:20.990 --> 11:23.410
It's data from experiments
completed ten years ago.

11:23.410 --> 11:26.910
This kind of thing happened
during the Eva's development?

11:26.910 --> 11:29.500
It was before I worked here.

11:29.500 --> 11:33.380
It seems my mother was here,
but I only know the data.

11:33.380 --> 11:36.000
And how did it come out back then?

11:36.000 --> 11:37.250
I heard they failed.

11:42.550 --> 11:44.260
Kindness...

11:44.600 --> 11:46.600
Warmth...

11:46.600 --> 11:49.020
Is this the warmth of a human?

11:49.930 --> 11:51.640
I never knew it.

11:55.480 --> 11:57.230
What is loneliness?

11:57.690 --> 12:01.990
I didn't understand it before, but I think I do now.

12:01.990 --> 12:03.740
What is happiness?

12:03.740 --> 12:07.790
I didn't understand it before, but I think I do now.

12:07.790 --> 12:11.540
Are others kind to you?

12:11.540 --> 12:12.620
Yes.

12:12.620 --> 12:14.080
Why?

12:14.080 --> 12:17.380
Because I'm an Eva pilot.

12:17.380 --> 12:20.300
Because I pilot Eva, they treat me well.

12:20.300 --> 12:23.680
That's the reason why I'm allowed to be here.

12:23.680 --> 12:25.970
It's all that sustains me.

12:25.970 --> 12:28.720
So I have to pilot Eva.

12:28.720 --> 12:30.060
Pilot, and?

12:30.060 --> 12:34.310
Enemy! Yes, I have to fight what
everyone calls the enemy!

12:34.310 --> 12:35.600
Fight, and?

12:35.600 --> 12:37.020
I have to win!

12:37.020 --> 12:39.400
Right, I mustn't lose.

12:39.400 --> 12:41.900
I have to pilot the Eva as I'm told.

12:41.900 --> 12:44.490
And I have to win as I'm told!

12:45.280 --> 12:47.120
Otherwise...

12:47.120 --> 12:48.450
Nobody...

12:48.450 --> 12:50.080
Nobody...

12:50.080 --> 12:51.700
Nobody...

12:53.460 --> 12:54.870
Do your best.

12:54.870 --> 12:55.870
Do your best.

12:55.870 --> 12:58.250
What are you doing? Do it right.

12:58.250 --> 12:59.420
Do your best, man.

12:59.420 --> 13:00.750
Do your best.

13:00.750 --> 13:03.170
Good work, Shinji.

13:03.170 --> 13:07.550
Miss Misato, Miss Ritsuko, Asuka, Toji, Kensuke,

13:07.550 --> 13:09.220
and Father.

13:09.220 --> 13:10.640
They all praise me.

13:10.930 --> 13:13.600
When I pilot Eva, they all praise me.

13:13.600 --> 13:16.650
They praise someone like me,
and they all tell me to pilot it.

13:16.650 --> 13:18.110
Father...

13:18.110 --> 13:20.320
The father that abandoned me... I'll show him!

13:21.320 --> 13:23.110
Do your best.

13:23.110 --> 13:24.820
I'm doing my best.

13:24.820 --> 13:26.410
I am doing my best!

13:27.870 --> 13:30.240
Somebody be nice to me.

13:30.240 --> 13:34.290
I've fought so hard! I'm fighting
with everything I've got!

13:34.290 --> 13:36.080
Treat me well!

13:36.080 --> 13:37.670
Be nice to me!

13:42.300 --> 13:44.090
I am nice to you.

13:47.050 --> 13:50.970
Tell me, Shinji, do you want
to become one with me?

13:50.970 --> 13:53.600
To be of one mind and body?

13:53.600 --> 13:56.730
It's a very, very comforting feeling.

13:56.730 --> 13:59.520
It's okay, you know. I'm okay whenever you are.

13:59.520 --> 14:03.780
Hey, stupid Shinji, don't you want
to become one with me?

14:03.780 --> 14:06.610
To be of one mind and body?

14:06.610 --> 14:10.450
Because it's a very, very comforting feeling.

14:10.450 --> 14:13.620
You don't hear me say this every day.
Come over here already.

14:13.950 --> 14:17.330
Ikari, do you want to become one with me?

14:17.330 --> 14:20.000
To be of one mind and body?

14:20.000 --> 14:23.050
It's a very, very comforting feeling.

14:23.050 --> 14:24.380
Ikari?

14:24.380 --> 14:26.220
Do you want to become one with me?

14:26.220 --> 14:28.380
To be of one mind and body?

14:28.380 --> 14:31.100
It's a very, very comforting feeling.

14:31.600 --> 14:34.890
Come on, relax, and release your soul.

14:36.600 --> 14:39.020
All investigative probes inserted.

14:39.020 --> 14:42.110
Fixed at electromagnetic radius
of zero minus three.

14:43.440 --> 14:45.570
Ego border pulse connection is complete.

14:45.570 --> 14:47.950
Roger. Start salvage.

14:47.950 --> 14:50.360
Roger, transmitting first signal.

14:50.360 --> 14:53.030
Eva has received the signal.
No sign of rejection.

14:53.030 --> 14:56.370
Proceeding to transmit second and third signals.

14:56.370 --> 14:58.710
Subject cathexis is normal.

14:58.710 --> 15:00.580
Destrudo cannot be confirmed.

15:00.580 --> 15:03.290
Roger, shift the subject to stage two.

15:03.630 --> 15:04.920
Shinji!

15:04.920 --> 15:05.090
Shinji!

15:05.090 --> 15:05.960
Asuka

15:05.090 --> 15:05.960
Stupid Shinji!

15:05.960 --> 15:06.260
Stupid Shinji!

15:06.260 --> 15:06.630
Stupid Shinji!

15:06.420 --> 15:07.300
Ritsuko

15:06.630 --> 15:07.300
Shinji!

