15:27.440 --> 15:29.610
Try firing all range of waveforms in all directions.

15:30.740 --> 15:34.490
It's not working. The signals are being
trapped in Klein space.

15:34.490 --> 15:35.990
What does that mean?

15:35.990 --> 15:37.660
It means we failed.

15:38.580 --> 15:40.870
Abort intervention. Reverse tangent plug.

15:40.870 --> 15:42.540
Return the additive value to zero.

15:42.540 --> 15:43.210
Yes, Ma'am.

15:43.210 --> 15:46.300
Destrudo reaction in the old area. Pattern sepia.

15:46.300 --> 15:49.970
We've detected a change in the core pulse too!
Plus 0.3 is confirmed!

15:49.970 --> 15:53.090
Maintenance of the status quo is top priority.
Prevent back flow.

15:53.090 --> 15:54.550
Yes, Ma'am.

15:54.550 --> 15:58.100
Plus 0.5... 0.8... This is odd. I can't stop it!

15:58.100 --> 16:00.230
What is this? Why?

16:00.230 --> 16:02.270
Don't you want to come back, Shinji?

16:02.940 --> 16:04.690
I don't understand.

16:05.230 --> 16:06.820
I don't understand.

16:07.730 --> 16:10.360
I... I...

16:11.860 --> 16:13.660
What do you wish?

16:13.660 --> 16:15.240
What do you wish?

16:15.240 --> 16:16.830
What do you wish?

16:16.830 --> 16:18.490
What do you wish?

16:19.950 --> 16:21.830
Eva has rejected the signal.

16:21.830 --> 16:24.960
The self-formation of LCL is breaking down.

16:24.960 --> 16:26.540
Pressure in the plug is increasing!

16:26.540 --> 16:28.670
Abort all operations. Drop the power.

16:28.670 --> 16:30.590
It's not working. The plug is venting!

16:37.010 --> 16:37.930
Shinji!

16:43.560 --> 16:44.520
Where am I?

16:44.520 --> 16:46.020
Inside the Eva.

16:46.020 --> 16:47.770
Inside the Eva?

16:47.770 --> 16:51.150
Did I pilot the Eva again? Why?

16:51.150 --> 16:52.950
You won't pilot the Eva anymore?

16:53.400 --> 16:56.740
I've decided I will never pilot Eva again.

16:56.740 --> 16:59.830
But you did pilot Evangelion Unit 01.

17:00.370 --> 17:04.080
Shinji, you are here now
because you piloted the Eva.

17:05.080 --> 17:07.790
You are the person you are now
because you piloted the Eva.

17:08.670 --> 17:11.630
You cannot deny it, that you
in fact piloted the Eva,

17:11.630 --> 17:15.760
nor can you deny the self that you have
been so far, which is your past.

17:16.640 --> 17:20.060
But as for what you will do from now on,

17:20.760 --> 17:22.100
you must decide for yourself.

17:23.430 --> 17:26.560
I... I...

17:28.900 --> 17:33.280
If it can't... If it can't even save one life,
then what good is science?!

17:33.900 --> 17:37.030
Give Shinji back! Give him back!

17:43.620 --> 17:45.210
A smell...

17:45.210 --> 17:46.790
A person's smell?

17:48.170 --> 17:49.790
Miss Misato?

17:50.250 --> 17:51.840
Ayanami?

17:51.840 --> 17:53.590
No, not them.

17:53.920 --> 17:55.630
That's right.

17:55.630 --> 17:57.340
This is the smell of my mother.

17:58.640 --> 18:04.730
So he will live in this world,
in the hell after the Second Impact?

18:04.730 --> 18:09.520
Oh, but if you have the will to live,
anywhere can be heaven.

18:09.520 --> 18:11.820
Because he is alive.

18:11.820 --> 18:14.780
He'll have plenty of chances to find happiness.

18:14.780 --> 18:17.280
I see. That's very true.

18:17.610 --> 18:18.780
Mother...

18:20.910 --> 18:22.370
Have you decided yet?

18:22.370 --> 18:26.250
If it's a boy, Shinji. If it's a girl,
I'll name her Rei.

18:26.250 --> 18:28.670
Shinji... Rei...

18:30.830 --> 18:31.920
Mother...

18:49.100 --> 18:50.020
Shinji!

18:51.520 --> 18:54.440
<i><i>Sure, I can understand, but I guess
that's what's called the oral stage.</i></i>

18:53.150 --> 18:56.900
The restoration of Unit 01 will be complete
the day after tomorrow.

18:54.440 --> 18:57.150
<i><i>It's something a psychologist
came up with a long time ago.</i></i>

18:56.900 --> 19:02.780
In the end, I guess humans will even use
God's powers as a tool.

18:57.150 --> 18:59.860
<i><i>In other words, it's where you want
to be with your mother forever.</i></i>

18:59.860 --> 19:02.620
<i><i>It refers to people who want to always
be dependent on someone.</i></i>

19:02.620 --> 19:05.290
<i><i>There's someone like that among my
acquaintences too, and you're a lot like him.</i></i>

19:02.780 --> 19:04.120
I don't know about that.

19:04.120 --> 19:06.830
I hear some on the committee
have even suggested a freeze.

19:05.290 --> 19:08.000
<i><i>So, well, as far as I can see from your letter,
from your girlfriend's standpoint,</i></i>

19:07.000 --> 19:09.460
The artificial human Evangelion...

19:08.000 --> 19:10.710
<i><i>being your lover, your mother,
and what else, your kid sister?</i></i>

19:09.750 --> 19:13.840
For it being man-made, don't you think
the black box of unknowns is too large?

19:10.710 --> 19:13.460
<i><i>I think being all of these things
for you is pretty rough.</i></i>

19:13.460 --> 19:15.800
<i><i>And you know, aren't you sort of taking
advantage of her place as a lover,</i></i>

19:15.550 --> 19:19.590
Well, not that I care, since Shinji
was ultimately saved.

19:15.800 --> 19:18.630
<i><i>Using it as your personal outlet for your libido?</i></i>

19:18.630 --> 19:21.470
<i><i>Okay, well, that might have been a little extreme.</i></i>

19:20.050 --> 19:24.550
That wasn't me. It was you, probably.

19:21.470 --> 19:24.300
<i><i>But a woman is very sensitive to whether
someone loves her or not.</i></i>

19:24.300 --> 19:26.640
<i><i>So I think she's probably
twigged onto that by now,</i></i>

19:26.640 --> 19:29.480
<i><i>that you're looking for a mother
you can sleep with in her.</i></i>

19:26.890 --> 19:29.940
How about it? Want to go out
for a drink for once?

19:29.480 --> 19:32.310
<i><i>And if she still hasn't brought up
splitting up with you,</i></i>

19:30.690 --> 19:33.650
Sorry, I've got somewhere to go today.

19:32.310 --> 19:34.770
<i><i>She might be one of those nice girls that
are pretty rare these days, you know?</i></i>

19:34.150 --> 19:34.770
I see.

19:36.190 --> 19:37.280
See you!

19:42.030 --> 19:45.660
Going on a tryst with a man the moment
she knows that Shinji is safe?

19:47.240 --> 19:49.080
I guess I'm in no position to talk.

19:49.750 --> 19:55.630
Ritsuko must be thinking I'm pretty
disgusting right about now.

19:56.040 --> 19:58.920
Indulging our carnal desires
is more realistic as humans.

19:59.550 --> 20:01.340
We can fool them a little.

20:01.340 --> 20:03.390
Our Intelligence Department?

20:03.390 --> 20:05.930
Or Commander Ikari and Ritsuko?

20:06.470 --> 20:08.390
Or me?

20:08.390 --> 20:10.350
No, myself.

20:10.350 --> 20:11.940
You mean others, don't you?

20:13.100 --> 20:18.230
You don't have any interest in others,
but you want their attention anyway.

20:18.230 --> 20:19.780
You really are just like my father.

20:21.570 --> 20:24.160
I didn't know you still smoked.

20:24.610 --> 20:27.370
I only smoke after this sort of thing.

20:27.660 --> 20:30.410
So nobody knows but you.

20:31.000 --> 20:33.670
Well, I'm honored.

20:34.250 --> 20:39.550
So, how far has the Human
Instrumentality Project gotten?

20:40.090 --> 20:42.170
Adam, destroyer of humanity.

20:42.760 --> 20:44.890
Why is it being kept underground?

20:45.800 --> 20:48.930
Are you seeing me because
you want to know that?

20:50.220 --> 20:52.640
Well, that's one of the reasons, to be honest.

20:53.770 --> 20:57.060
I'm most honored to be used by a lady,

20:57.060 --> 20:59.020
but I can't tell you in a place like this.

20:59.020 --> 21:01.900
All I care about right now is for you
to understand what I want.

21:02.360 --> 21:06.870
What is Nerv's and Commander Ikari's
true objective?

21:07.320 --> 21:09.370
I'd like to know that myself.

21:14.870 --> 21:18.960
Hey, don't dodge my questions by doing that!

21:46.570 --> 21:48.110
Hey, no!

21:48.110 --> 21:50.030
Don't put strange things in there!

21:50.950 --> 21:53.500
What are you doing at a time like this?
What's that?

21:53.500 --> 21:56.080
A present for you, the first in eight years.

21:57.420 --> 21:59.290
Though it may be the last.

21:59.330 --> 22:00.880
TO BE CONTINUED

